Ethereum Compound V3 Fork Withdraw

GIVEN the Ethereum child Compound v3 adapter
  WHEN a caller other than the vault withdraws
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN the vault withdraws more than TVL
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN the vault withdraws a specific amount
    THEN USDC returns from live Compound v3 and TVL decreases
  WHEN the vault withdraws the max amount
    THEN all supplied USDC returns from live Compound v3
